<title>UK: NordLB sets 1.5 bln mark five-year bond.</title>
<headline>NordLB sets 1.5 bln mark five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following redenominatable bond was announced by joint lead managers BGB, BayerLB, CDC, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, NordLB, Trinkaus and Burkhardt and WestLB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.5 PCT   MATURITY    =d.mmm.yr</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    =d.mmm.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+18 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 DENOMS (K) 10	  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    8 BP	SELL CONC   17 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE IS A REDENOMINATION CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
